README
------

* Hello.java:      demonstrates how to display an output window using SWING

* Image.java:      demonstrates how to display an output window using SWING.
                   display an JPEG image

* Inputfield.java: demonstrates how to display an output window using SWING.
                   input field is a standard SWING entry box with 
                   description, and buttons. simple code without any input 
                   validation.

